// which clears the twenty, and 30 across -- and it fits inside the paved disc
// round 154 doubled (18 tiles for a hamlet, 22-28 for a village).
const SMALL_CROSS_TILES = 15;
// ...AND THE WHOLE CROSS IS TURNED TWENTY DEGREES, because the first cut put
