// main gameplay is actually slightly too far zoomed in. Can we maybe set both
// indoor and outdoor to the halfway point between these 2 points."
//
// Measured, the interior fit-the-whole-room zoom worked out at 0.83-1.13
// depending on window size, against an outdoor 1.6. 1.25 is the midpoint, and
