      // while, you are the thing you are pretending to be. The card has been
      // able to print this since round 201 and the generator has been able to
      // roll it since earlier today; this is the branch that makes pressing
      // the button do something, and without it the ability was a card.
      //
      // All four halves of the canon clause at once, off ONE table read, so
      // the thing the player was promised and the thing that happens cannot
