    // performed the LEAD effect and everything below applies what rides on top
    // of it. Before the stealth and taunt riders so a composed veil is not
    // applied twice by two different doors.
    // ROUND 112 -- the rank goes WITH the call. `key` is in scope here and the
    // ability object is not enough on its own: which rank an ability is at is
    // a property of the SLOT it sits in, not of the ability.
