      // names `auraEffect: 'damage'` any more and 'damage' is out of
      // AURA_LIVE_EFFECTS, so the branch was unreachable -- and unreachable
      // code that deals damage is one table edit away from being reachable
      // again, which is precisely the thing the user asked to be rid of. Its
