      // 0.15. The taunt arc lives 0.35s (it has further to travel and it is the
      // only cue that a monster has changed who it is coming for), and against
      // a fixed divisor it would have sat at full opacity for its first 0.2s
      // and then snapped out. `ttl0` defaults so the round-48 chain arcs, which
      // do not set it, keep exactly the fade they had.
      z.line.setAlpha(Math.max(0, Math.min(1, z.ttl / (z.ttl0 || 0.15))));
